    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="1195" n="1189" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1189"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Willis.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State,</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-28"><hi rendition="#italic">September 28,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith a letter from the
                    President recalling Mr. James H. Blount as envoy extraordinary and minister
                    plenipotentiary of the United States to the Hawaiian Islands, with an office
                    copy thereof. This letter you will present to the President of the Provisional
                    Government, with your letter of credence, having previously sent the copy to the
                    foreign office, and explain that Mr. Blount is unable to present it in person by
                    reason of his having resigned the office while in the United States.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
